      "text": "Enjoy two days without scheduled sightseeing excursions on a private island in Boca Chica.\n\nThe resort offers guided ecological trails, non-motorised water activities including kayaking and paddleboarding, and an outdoor yoga studio. Choose a guided nature walk, or simply spend the day beside the ocean.\n\nMeals include breakfast, lunch, snacks and a three-course dinner. Local beer, wine and cocktails are included.",
